{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rome's Revenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Scipio Aemilianus during the Third Punic War and annihilate Carthage's resistance across three new missions for Citadelum, dating back to 149 BC. Establish Rome's dominance over the Mediterranean once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Missions and Unprecedented Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face entirely new challenges, designed to fully leverage all the features of Citadelum's 2.0 &quot;Julius&quot; update. Deploy your legions and lead your troops against a formidable enemy that will put your strategic skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Unique Desert Biome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >North Africa presents a unique terrain with additional difficulties, such as resource scarcity. Build your settlements in a hostile, desert environment and direct one of the military operations that would change history forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896670?t=1762448508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896670?t=1762448508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896670/bcddf5277216daddbd901fa88e5590b4f60b79fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762448508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896670/bcddf5277216daddbd901fa88e5590b4f60b79fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762448508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","i